### Assessment

The system was operating with permissive default policies and no visible filtering rules at the time of inspection. This configuration provides limited traffic restriction and should not automatically be considered appropriate for a production or internet-facing system. A secure configuration should be designed according to the system's role, required services, and organizational security requirements.

